by inserting after paragraph (6) (as so redesignated) the following:“(7) 
Definitions.Major project.—“(A) In general.—The term ‘major project’ means a project for which—“(i) multiple permits, approvals, reviews, or studies are required under a Federal law other than the National Environmental Policy Act of 1969 (42 U.S.C. 4321 et seq.);
