by inserting after paragraph (2) the following:“(3) Reporting.—The Secretary shall establish minimum reporting requirements for grant recipients under this subsection, which may include, with respect to a program carried out with a grant under this subsection—135 STAT. 641“(A) the percentage or number of program participants that are employed during the second quarter after exiting the program;
