by amending paragraph (1) to read as follows:“(1) In general.—Direct loans and loan guarantees authorized under this section shall be used—“(A) to acquire, improve, or rehabilitate intermodal or rail equipment or facilities, including track, components of track, cuts and fills, stations, tunnels, bridges, yards, buildings, and shops, and to finance costs related to those activities, including pre-construction costs;
